      "prose": "This content concerns Earendale, a small floating island town of 57 residents that broke off from the ear of a giant landform called the Great Head. The town is home to magical birds called wordlarks near hot springs, and a resort and spa that draws hundreds of visitors seeking emotional healing. A Handbook item is also present, likely serving as a reference tool for the player.",
