      "supportLanguage": "en",
      "prose": "The player has just arrived at Wordlark Hollow's Arrival Station, where Horace Pennyfeather, the Station Manager, greets them and welcomes them to town. Something is irregular today — the people who were supposed to be waiting for the player are nowhere to be found — and Horace suggests checking further into the station. The scene also introduces colorful townsfolk including Finnick Thorn, an anthropomorphic prairie dog who runs a cheese shop, and hints at the broader world of Earendale.",
